Data availability

            The datasets analysed in this study are publicly available from their original sources: the ZECMIP model output from ref. 7; the AR6-calibrated FaIR ensemble and forcing data from refs. 31,34; the historical emissions reconstruction from the Indicators of Global Climate Change dataset25; and the SSP emissions from ref. 40. The processed data generated in this study are available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10120439 (ref. 73).
          Code availability

            The code used to perform the analysis and generate the figures in this study are available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10120439 (ref. 73).
